  "_id": "tg-seer",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Prophet was beforetime called a Seer, 1 Sam. 9:9. Samuel answered … I am the seer, 1 Sam. 9:19 (1 Chr. 26:28; 29:29). king said … Art not thou a seer, 2 Sam. 15:27. prophet Gad, David’s seer, 2 Sam. 24:11 (1 Chr. 21:9). Lord testified against Israel … by all the seers, 2 Kgs. 17:13. David and Samuel the seer did ordain, 1 Chr. 9:22. Heman the king’s seer, 1 Chr. 25:5. visions of Iddo the seer against Jeroboam, 2 Chr. 9:29. written in the book of … Iddo the seer concerning genealogies, 2 Chr. 12:15. Hanani the seer, 2 Chr. 16:7 (19:2). Asaph the seer, 2 Chr. 29:30. words of the seers that spake to him, 2 Chr. 33:18. Jeduthun the king’s seer, 2 Chr. 35:15. the seers hath he covered, Isa. 29:10. say to the seers, See not, Isa. 30:10. Amaziah said unto Amos, O thou seer, Amos 7:12.",
